# AgentLens Rules for Cursor

When asked to "review AgentLens issues" or "fix UI feedback":
1. Run `python3 cli/fetch_issues.py --repo <owner/repo>` to fetch the latest UI directives.
2. Group tasks by file to minimize file re-reads and context switching.
3. Locate elements using the reported `CSS Selector` or `Element Text`.
4. Apply minimal, clean modifications matching existing design tokens and framework patterns.
5. In your commit message or PR description, reference `fixes #<issue_number>` to automatically close the resolved issue on GitHub.
